            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/706440/extras/cba330f5e521340ddea79c2f066a0930.avif?t=1782119496\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>In a desert <strong>post-apocalyptic world</strong> ruled by cyborgs, you are the last soldier alive. Drive across defense lines and reach <strong>the evacuation point</strong> !<br><br>Explore the areas and find items, weapons. <strong>Listen to radio communications</strong> to find out what happened. Eliminate the cyborgs and their commanders !<br><br><strong><i>Arena mode</i></strong> with <strong>boost bonus</strong> to give <strong>high jumps, invulnerability, unlimited ammo, high speed</strong>, etc...",
